<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="container policy-page">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><%= siteName %> respects your privacy. This page explains what information we collect and how we use it.</p>

  <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Contact details you provide: name, phone number, email, and delivery address, when you create an account or place an order</li>
    <li>Order history and communication with us (e.g. chat messages)</li>
    <li>Basic usage data collected automatically through analytics and advertising tools (see below)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>To process and deliver your orders</li>
    <li>To contact you about your order (confirmation, delivery updates, support)</li>
    <li>To improve our website and product offering</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Analytics &amp; Advertising</h3>
  <p>We use Google Analytics and the Meta (Facebook) Pixel to understand how visitors use our site and to measure the effectiveness of our marketing. These tools may set cookies and collect information such as pages visited and purchases made. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

  <h3>Sharing Your Information</h3>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share only what is necessary with delivery couriers to fulfill your order, and with payment providers to process payments.</p>

  <h3>Data Security</h3>
  <p>We take reasonable measures to protect your information, including encrypted password storage. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>

  <h3>Your Choices</h3>
  <p>You can review or update your account details any time from your <a href="/account">Account</a> page. To request deletion of your data, contact us using the chat button on this site or call <%= shopPhone %>.</p>

  <h3>Contact</h3>
  <p>Questions about this policy? Contact us using the chat button on this site or call <%= shopPhone %>.</p>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
